<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>Dear Community Partner:</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>Thank you for your support throughout our search for the next police chief for the City of Columbus. Community engagement has been central to this process. We solicited more than 200 questions from residents for the virtual town hall and held numerous conversations with community stakeholders to solicit feedback – including from many of you.</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>Your thoughtful and active participation helped to inform my final selection. In order to make the changes and reforms we seek, we need a police chief who is  a transformational leader and committed to building relationships with our community. I am confident Chief Elaine Bryant is the right choice for our City and to lead this important work.</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>We previously shared that we would follow up with each stakeholder group to introduce you to Chief Bryant and provide you with an opportunity to share your thoughts and how your organization can best support her moving forward. We are working now to finalize details and preparations for her arrival and will be reaching out to you soon to schedule a meeting.</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>Thank you, again, for your meaningful contributions. I look forward to your continued engagement in the days and weeks ahead.</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>Sincerely,</em></p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/06/3429563/3097149/mag-signature-new_crop.png" style="width: 210px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="signature" width="210" height="112">
